# kin/youth/arms/arm_l: the youth's left arm (the right arm's partner; regions: U upper arm, C cuff, H hand)
# (P2b motion rollout 2026-10-22, KIN-YOUTH) the run pump keys at the youth's size with the adult's timing (kin_youth.clip:
# near pB pM pF pF pK pB, far pF pK pB pB pM pF): pB the arm driven back and flatter, pM forward-mid, pF the forearm up and
# forward (the fist at the chest), pK back-mid, pN passing; R views near, L views far (a value darker) on arm_r and the
# reverse on arm_l; the L near drawings the R mirrored and re-lit.
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Front and back as the right arm, mirrored and lit from the left;
# the left views are the right arm's side swings mirrored and re-lit; `back` (right view) the far hand peeking past the
# hip; `lie` (left view, lying) the arm limp along the side, the hand on the ground.
use person
body youth
role arms std
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys armL
side L

view D key idle origin 1 -1
mark handL 0 3
|765
|765
|765
|tsq
